  "body": "Here's your opportunity to secure a stylish, beautifully presented home in sought after Mairangi Bay, with the added bonus of a freehold site and potential to extend and create your forever home.\r\nJust a short stroll to Mairangi Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants, shops and parks, this home offers an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\nThoughtfully renovated, it features open plan living, beautifully finished bathrooms with underfloor heating, double glazing and polished native timber floors. Enjoy sunny outdoor living with a private front courtyard and elevated rear deck, plus the convenience of a triple carport.\r\nZoned for sought after schools, including Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Girls High School and Rangitoto College.\r\nWhether you're a first home buyer, young family or looking for future potential, this is a wonderful opportunity to secure a freehold property in the Bays and make it your own.\r\nViewing by appointment or as advertised.",
